{"schema":"dasa_pada_text","default_author":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","count":9,"bio_notes":"","items":[{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8985","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಇಂದಿರೇಶ ಭವಬಂಧನ ಬಿಡಿಸೊ","latin":"","iast":"iṃdireśa bhavabaṃdhana biḍisò","devanagari":"इंदिरेश भवबंधन बिडिसॊ"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಇಂದಿರೇಶ ಭವಬಂಧನ ಬಿಡಿಸೊ ನಿನ್ನಾನಂದದೊಳಿರಿಸೊ ಪ","ಸಿಂಧುಶಯನ ಗೋವಿಂದ ಮುರಾರೆ ಅಚಿಂತ್ಯಾದ್ಭುತ ಶೌರೆ ಅ.ಪ.","ತಾಳಲಾರೆನೊ ಈ ತಾಪತ್ರಯ ಹರಿಸೊ ನಿನ್ನವನೆನಿಸೊ","ಕಾಲಕರ್ಮ ಕೋಟಲೆ ತಪ್ಪದಲ್ಲ ನೀ ಕೇಳೆನ್ನ ಸೊಲ್ಲ","ಲಾಲಿಸಿ ಎನ್ನನು ಕೇಳೋ ಎನ್ನ ವಾಕು","ಪಾಲಿಸಿ ಎನ್ನನು ಪಾರುಗಾಣಿಸೊ ಫಣಿರಾಜಶಯ್ಯ","ಪರಿಪರಿಯಿಂದಲಿ ಜನ್ಮ ಧರಿಸಿ ಕರೆದುತಂದೆ","ಈ ಜನ್ಮದಿ ನಿಂದೆ ಅರಿಯದವರಂತಿರುವರೆ","ಕಾಯುವ ಕರುಣಿ ನೀನು ದೀನಜನ ಸುರಧೇನು","ಅಂಬರ ಮಣಿಯಂತೆ ಬಿಂಬ ಮೊಳಗ್ಹೊಳೆದು","ದುರಂತ ಕರ್ಮಂಗಳ ಕಳೆದು","ಹಂಬಲಿಸುವ ಭಕುತರ ಬೆಂಬಲಿಗನೆನಿಸಿ","ಸಂತತ ನಿನ್ನ ಸುಖಸಿರಿಯ ಸುರಿಸೊ","ಬಿಂಬವು ಒಲಿದರೆ ಪ್ರತಿಬಿಂಬ ಫಲಸುವದುಂಟು","ಈ ಮಾತು ನಿಘಂಟು ಬಾಂಬೊಳೆ ಹರಿಸಿದ ಹರಿ ಮಾನಿಧಿವಿಠಲ","ನೀನಲ್ಲದಿನ್ಯಾರೋ ದೇವರ ದೇವಾ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8985,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8986","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ದಯಮಾಡೋ ಹನುಮಾ","latin":"","iast":"dayamāḍo hanumā","devanagari":"दयमाडो हनुमा"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ದಯಮಾಡೋ ಹನುಮಾ ದಯಮಾಡೋ ಪ","ಎನ್ನೊಡನಾಡೋ ಬೇಡಿದ ವರಗಳ ಎನಗೆ ನೀಡೋ ಅ.ಪ.","ಅಂಜಾನಿಯ ಕಂದನೆ ಸಂಜೀವನ ತಂದನೆ","ಅಂಜಾದೆ ರಕ್ಕಸರ ಕೊಂದಾನೆ","ಕೀಟಕಾಂತಕನೆ ಕಿರೀಟ ಸಖನೆ","ಪಾಂಚಾಲಿ ಹೃತ್ಕುಮುದ ಚಂದ್ರನೆ","ಆನಂದತೀರ್ಥನೆ ಅಮ್ನಾಯಸ್ತುತನೆ","ಮಾನಿಧಿವಿಠಲನ ದೂತನೆ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8986,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8987","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ನಿನ್ನೊರತು ಇನ್ನಿಲ್ಲ ಹನುಮಾ","latin":"","iast":"ninnòratu innilla hanumā","devanagari":"निन्नॊरतु इन्निल्ल हनुमा"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ನಿನ್ನೊರತು ಇನ್ನಿಲ್ಲ ಹನುಮಾ","ಜಯ ಭೀಮಾ ಗುರುಮಧ್ವರಾಯಾ ಪ","ಅನ್ನವಸ್ತ್ರವ ಕೊಟ್ಟು ಅನ್ಯರಿಗೆ ಬೇಡಿಸದೆ","ಅನುಗಾಲವೂ ಕಾಯೋ ಅನುಪಮ ಚಿಂತನ","ಬಂದ ಬಂದ ಕಂಟಕವನ್ನು ಬಂದು ಬಂದೂ ಬಯಲು ಮಾಡಿ","ಎಂದೆಂದಿಗೂ ಕಾಯೋ ಸುಂದರ ಮೂರುತಿಯೇ","ಕದರೂರು ಹನುಮೇಶ ಹಸನ್ಮುಖವಿಠಲನ","ಮುದದಿಂದಲಿ ಒಲಿಸಿದ ಚದುರ ಮೂರುತಿಯೆ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8987,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8988","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ನೋಡೋ ಹನುಮ ನಂಬಿದೆ","latin":"","iast":"noḍo hanuma naṃbidè","devanagari":"नोडो हनुम नंबिदॆ"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ನೋಡೋ ಹನುಮ ನಂಬಿದೆ ಭೀಮಾ ವರಮಧ್ವರಾಯಾ ಪ","ತ್ರೇತಾಯುಗದಲಿ ರಾಮನ ಸೇವೆಗೆ ನೇಮದಿ ಬಂದು","ಆ ಲಂಕೆಯ ಬೆಂಕಿಗೆ ಆಹುತಿ ಇತ್ತ","ಹೃದಯವ ಹರಿಸಿದನವ ಮಾಡಿದ","ಹದನವ ತೋರಿಸೋ ಬುಧಜನ ನಮಿತನೆ","ದ್ವಾಪರ ಯುಗದಲಿ ಪರಮಾತ್ಮನ ಪೂಜಿಸಿ","ತೋರಿಸಿದಂಥ ಅಪಾರ ಮಹಿಮನೆ","ಕಲಿಯುಗದೊಳು ಮಹಾ ಖಳಮತಗಳನೆಲ್ಲಾ","ನಿನ್ನ ಸರಳಿಗಳಿಂದೊರಿಸಿದೆ ಅಕಳಂಕ ಮಹಿಮನೆ","ತಂದೆ ಹಸನ್ಮುಖವಿಠಲನ ಚಂದದಿಂದಲಿ ಪಾಡುವ","ಸುಂದರಮೂರುತಿಯೆ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8988,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8989","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಭಜಿಸೋ ಬೇಗ ಹರಿಯ","latin":"","iast":"bhajiso bega hariya","devanagari":"भजिसो बेग हरिय"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಭಜಿಸೋ ಬೇಗ ಹರಿಯ ಅಜಭವಾಶ್ರಿತ ನಿಜ ದೊರೆಯ ಪ","ಕಾಮಕ್ರೋಧವ ಬಿಟ್ಟು ಮನಸಿನೊಳಗೆ","ರಾಮ ಮೂರುತಿಯಿಟ್ಟು ಪ್ರೇಮ ತಿಳಿದಷ್ಟು","ಆದಷ್ಟು ಕಾಮಿತಾರ್ಥವ ಕೊಟ್ಟು","ಹೇಮಗರ್ಭಭವ ಸೋಮ ಸೂರ್ಯರಿಗೆಲ್ಲ","ನಿಯಮನ ಮಾಡುವ ಮಹಾ ದೈವವ ಬಿಟ್ಟು ಇರಸಲ್ಲ","ಜಗದೊಳಜಾಮಿಳ ಬಲ್ಲ ನಂಬಿ ಕೆಟ್ಟವರಿಲ್ಲ","ಧ್ರುವಬಲ ಇಂಬುಗೊಂಡರಲ್ಲ ತುಂಬಿದ ಸಭೆಯೊಳಾಂಬುಜಾಕ್ಷಿ","ಮಾನಗೊಂಬಾಗ ಅಂಬರ ದೃಷ್ಟಿ ಸುರಿಸಿದ","ಒಂದೇ ಮನದಿ ಭಜಿಸೆ ಭವವೆಂಬೋ ಬಂಧನವ ಬಿಡಿಸುವ","ಮುಂದೆ ಮುಕ್ತಿಯ ಹರಿಸಿ ಕೊಡುವನು ಚಂದದಿ ಅನುಕರಿಸಿ","ಬಂಧ ಮೋಕ್ಷಪ್ರದ ಮಾನಿಧಿವಿಠಲನ","ಇಂದಿಗೂ ಮುಂದಿಗೂ ಬಿಡದೆ ನೀನೆಂದೆಂದಿಗೂ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8989,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8990","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಯದುರ್ಯಾರು ನಿಲ್ಲುವರೋ ಹನುಮರಾಯಾ","latin":"","iast":"yaduryāru nilluvaro hanumarāyā","devanagari":"यदुर्यारु निल्लुवरो हनुमराया"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಯದುರ್ಯಾರು ನಿಲ್ಲುವರೋ ಹನುಮರಾಯಾ ನಿನಗೆದುರ್ಯಾರು","ನಿಲ್ಲುವರಯ್ಯಾ ಈ ಜಗತ್ರಯದಿ ಪ","ಮದನ ಶರಾರ್ಬತ [?] ಕದನ ಕರ್ಕಶ ಧೀರಮಣಿಯೇ ಅ.ಪ.","ಜನನಿಯ ಜಠರದಿ ಜನಿಸಿದಾಗಲೆ ದಿವಮಂಡಲಕೆ ಹಾರಿದೆ","ದನುಜಾಂತಕ ರಾಘವನ ಸೇವೆ ಮನದಣಿಯೆ","ಮಾಡಿ ದುರಂಧರನೆನಿಸಿದೆ","ದುರುಳ ದುಶ್ಶಾಸನನ ರಕುತವ ಹೀರಿ ಕರುಳು ಬಗೆವಾಗ","ಧುರದಲಿ ಅಷ್ಟು ವೀರರಿದ್ದು ಬಿಡಿಸಿಕೊಳ್ಳಲಾರದೆ","ಮಾರಿ ತಗ್ಗಿಸಿ ಕೆಲಸಾರಿದರಲ್ಲದೆ","ಗುರುಮಧ್ವರಾಯಾ ದ್ವೈತವನು ಸಿದ್ಧಾಂತವ","ಮಾಡಿ ಅದ್ವೈತ ಮತವ ಗೆದ್ದು","ಮಾನಿಧಿವಿಠಲನ ಸೂಸಿ ಪೂಜಿಸಿ ಮೆರೆದೆಯಾ","ಮದ್ಗುರು ಮುನಿಮೌನಿರಾಮಾ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8990,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8991","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಯಾರೇನು ಮಾಡುವರೋ ಹರಿಯೇ","latin":"","iast":"yārenu māḍuvaro hariye","devanagari":"यारेनु माडुवरो हरिये"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಯಾರೇನು ಮಾಡುವರೋ ಹರಿಯೇ","ಯಾರಿಂದಲೇನಹುದು ಪ","ವಾರಿಜಾಂಬಕ ಮಾರಜನಕ","ಹಾರ ಕೌಸ್ತುಭ ವಕ್ಷ ಶ್ರೀಶಾ ಅ.ಪ.","ಅಜ ಈ ಜಗ ಸೃಜಿಸಿದನೆ","ಶ್ರೀದೇವಿಯು ನಿಜಗುಣ ನೆಲೆಗಂಡಳೆ","ಭುಜಗಭೂಷಣ ಆಯಕರ್ತನಾದರೆ","ಭಜಕನಾ ಬಯಕೆ ಬಾಯಬಿಡುವದೆ","ಸುರಪ ಸುರರೊಡೆಯನೆ ಧರಣಿ","ಈ ಉರಗೇಂದ್ರ ಪೊತ್ತಿದನೆ","ದುರುಳನ ಭಯಕೆ ಪುರವ ಬಿಟ್ಟೋಡಿದ","ಧರಣಿಯ ದುರುಳನೊಯ್ಯೆ","ವರಾಹರೂಪದಿ ತಂದೆ ನೀ ತಂದೆ ಹರಿಯೇ","ಶ್ರೀಪತಿ ಸುರತತಿಯ ಸೃಜಿಸಿ","ಈಪ್ಸಿತಾರ್ಥಗಳನೆಲ್ಲಾ ಅವರಿಗೆ","ಸ್ವಾಪ್ನಜಾಗೃತಿಯಲಿ ಪರಿಪಾಲಿಸೆ","ಮಹಾನಿಧಿವಿಠಲ ನೀನಲ್ಲದಿನ್ಯಾರೋ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8991,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8992","form":"pada","form_confidence":"default bucket, not a positive signal","title":{"kn":"ಶಾಮಸುಂದರ ಪೊರೆಯೊ","latin":"","iast":"śāmasuṃdara pòrèyò","devanagari":"शामसुंदर पॊरॆयॊ"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:0","form:pada"],"raga":"","tala":"","singer":"","style":"","music_director":"","studio":"","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ಶಾಮಸುಂದರ ಪೊರೆಯೊ ರಘುರಾಮಾ","ಕಾಮಿತ ಫಲವಿತ್ತು ಪ","ಸೋಮಧಾಮ ಸುತ್ತಾಮ ಸುರಾರ್ಚಿತ","ಕರುಣದಿ ದಯವಿತ್ತು ಅ.ಪ.","ತಟಿತ್ಕೋಟಿ ನಿಭ ಹಾಟಕಾಂಬರನೆ","ಘಟಿತವಾದ ಈ ಜಟಿಲ ಶರಧಿಯೊಳು","ನಟ ನಡುವೆ ಸಿಲುಕಿ ಗುಟಕ ನೀರು ಕುಡಿದ ಈ","ಪುಟ [ಟ್ಟ] ಪುರುಷನ ಮೇಲೆ ದೃಷ್ಟಿ ಇಟ್ಟು ನೋಡಿದರೆ","ಪಟುಲವೇನೋ ವಟಪತ್ರಶಯನನೆ","ನಟವಳಿಯೊಳು ಈ ಭಕುತ ಕಟಕಿಯ ಮಾಡೆ","ಚಂಡ ವಿಕ್ರಮ ಕೋದಂಡ ದೀಕ್ಷಾ ಖಂಡ ಮಹಿಮಾರಾಮಾ","ಖಂಡ ಪರಶುಮಾರ್ತಾಂಡ ಸುರಾರ್ಚಿತ ಪಂಡಿತ ರಣಭೀಮಾ","ದುರಿತವೇಕೋ ಗಂಡ ಕಂಠೀರವನೆ ಡಿಂಗರಿಗಾತಿ ಪ್ರೇಮಾ","ಅಂಡಜವಾಹನ ಪಾಂಡವ ಮೂರುತಿ ಕುಂಡಲಗಿರಿಧಾಮಾ","ಘನಚರಿತ ಪ್ರಸನ್ನ ದಯಾಂಬುಧಿ ಇನ್ನಾದರೂ ಈ ಚಿಣ್ಣಗೆ","ಚೆನ್ನಾಗಿ ದೃಷ್ಟಿಯಿಟ್ಟು ಕೃಪೆಮಾಡು ಸನ್ನುತಿಸುವೆ ಮುನ್ನಾ","ಕಣ್ಣೆತ್ತಿ ನೋಡದೆ ಅನ್ನ ದೈªಂಗಳ ಬಿನ್ನವಿಸುವೆ ನಿನ್ನಾ","ಮನ್ಮಥಪಿತ ಭೋ ಮಹಾನಿಧಿವಿಠಲ ಅಹರಹದಿ ನಿನ್ನಾ ಚನ್ನಾ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8992,"category_raw":0,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":false},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]},{"id":"mahanithivithala__dasa1_8993","form":"devaranama","form_confidence":"sampled, consistent structured header (song/singer/raga/tala/style)","title":{"kn":"ದಯಮಾಡೋ ಹನುಮಾ","latin":"","iast":"dayamāḍo hanumā","devanagari":"दयमाडो हनुमा"},"composer":"ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","composer_iast":"mahānithiviṭhala","deity":"","tags":["composer:ಮಹಾನಿಥಿವಿಠಲ","source:android_app_local:dasa1","category_raw:4","form:devaranama","rendition:studio_recording"],"raga":"ರೀತಿಗೌಳ","tala":"ಆದಿ ತಾಳ","singer":"ನೀಲಾ ರಾಮಗೋಪಾಲ್","style":"","music_director":"ನೀಲಾ ರಾಮಗೋಪಾಲ್","studio":"ಅರವಿಂದ್ ಸ್ಟುಡಿಯೊ, ಬೆಂಗಳೂರು","language":"kn","text":{"kannada":[["ದಯಮಾಡೋ ಹನುಮಾ","ದಯಮಾಡೋ ಹನುಮಾ ದಯಮಾಡೋ ಪ","ಎನ್ನೊಡನಾಡೋ ಬೇಡಿದ ವರಗಳ ಎನಗೆ ನೀಡೋ ಅ.ಪ.","ಅಂಜಾನಿಯ ಕಂದನೆ ಸಂಜೀವನ ತಂದನೆ","ಅಂಜಾದೆ ರಕ್ಕಸರ ಕೊಂದಾನೆ","ಕೀಟಕಾಂತಕನೆ ಕಿರೀಟ ಸಖನೆ","ಪಾಂಚಾಲಿ ಹೃತ್ಕುಮುದ ಚಂದ್ರನೆ","ಆನಂದತೀರ್ಥನೆ ಅಮ್ನಾಯಸ್ತುತನೆ","ಮಾನಿಧಿವಿಠಲನ ದೂತನೆ"]],"iast":[],"devanagari":[],"source_roman":[]},"meaning":"","source":{"site":"android_app_local_asset:dasa1","url":"","attribution":"Imported from a local Android app database asset (dasa1); non-commercial dharma-prachara / education / research.","fetched":"2026-08-19"},"app_meta":{"asset":"dasa1","dasaru_id":174,"keerthana_id":8993,"category_raw":4,"favorite":false,"header_stripped":["ನಿರ್ಗಮನ"],"unclassified_lines":[],"is_recorded_rendition":true},"_needs_review":false,"also_at":[]}]}